036400 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
036500 1-HOUSEKEEP.
           OPEN INPUT DPORECD-I DPOITEM MSTORERM-I MPORCV-I.
           OPEN I-O   MPLTINFO-O
                      MPORCV-O
                      DDAILYTC
                      DPOITEM-O
                      DVENDITM-O
                      DRCVITEM-O
                      MSTORERM-O.
037200
           MOVE 1 TO DATE-MODE.
           CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA.
           MOVE DATE-YMD-OUT        TO PRT-DATE, ACTIVITY-DATE.
           ACCEPT TRANS-TIME        FROM TIME.
037500     MOVE HH            TO  WS-HH.
037600     MOVE MIN           TO  WS-MIN.
037700     MOVE SS            TO  WS-SS.
037800     MOVE WS-TIME       TO  PRT-TIME.
037900
038000     OPEN INPUT REC-INPUT
038100          OUTPUT PRINT-FILE.
038200
038300     MOVE STAR-LINE    TO PRT-REC.
038400     WRITE PRT-REC AFTER ADVANCING 2 LINES.
038500     WRITE PRT-REC AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.
038600     MOVE REPORT-TITLE TO PRT-REC.
038700     WRITE PRT-REC AFTER ADVANCING 3 LINES.
038800     MOVE PRINT-HEADING-TITLE TO PRT-REC.
038900     WRITE PRT-REC AFTER ADVANCING 2 LINES.
039000
039100     GO TO 3-FIND-START-LABEL.
039200
039300 2-EOJ.
039400     MOVE RECORD-RECV-MESSAGE     TO  PRT-REC.
039500     WRITE PRT-REC AFTER ADVANCING 3 LINES.
039600     MOVE RECORD-COUNT            TO  TOT-REC-PROCESS.
039700     MOVE RECORD-COUNTER-MESSAGE  TO  PRT-REC.
039800     WRITE PRT-REC AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.
039900
